=== why min inter-center spacing is NOT the bin width (ps1 slow) ===
first 8 centers: [0.158985 0.219728 0.259985 0.320347 0.360986 0.420965 0.461986 0.521584]
first 7 spacings: [0.060743 0.040257 0.060362 0.040639 0.05998  0.041021 0.059598]
two interleaved 0.10-wide grids offset by ~0.05 -> alternating spacing;
legitimate resolution of the merged series is ~0.10 MHz/s, not 0.04.

